# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Regenerable dataset cache (~160 MB). raw/, split/ and mapping/ ARE tracked:
# with those present, ogb rebuilds processed/ offline in about 10 seconds, so a
# clone never needs the network to get the data.
dataset/*/processed/

# Large regenerable binaries, in results/ and every variant of it:
#   *.pkl  WEGL embedding caches, ~150 MB per seed, ~2 min to rebuild
#   *.pt   trained PNA checkpoints, ~2.8 MB each
# The .npz predictions ARE tracked - every table and figure in the README is
# rebuilt from those alone, with no retraining.
*.pkl
*.pt

# Personal rehearsal notes, not part of the project's documentation.
TALKING_POINTS.md
